### listar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### listar con paginacion, busqueda y filtro por sucursal
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen?limit=5&search=central&sucursal_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### crear
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Almacen Principal",
    "codigo": "ALM-001",
    "descripcion": "Almacen principal de la sucursal central",
    "sucursal_id": 1
}

### crear solo con campos obligatorios
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Almacen Secundario",
    "sucursal_id": 1
}

### crear con datos invalidos (espera 422)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre": "",
    "sucursal_id": 9999
}

### mostrar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### mostrar inexistente (espera 404)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### modificar
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Almacen Principal Actualizado",
    "codigo": "ALM-001-B",
    "descripcion": "Descripcion actualizada",
    "sucursal_id": 1
}

### modificar con datos invalidos (espera 422)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Solo nombre"
}

### eliminar
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### sin token (espera 401)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen
Accept: application/json
